<h4>API Tester</h4>
<p>Use the API Tester to make API calls to Datasets. The API Tester requires an access token. If you have forgotten or
    do not have a token, <a href="https://www.huduser.gov/hudapi/public/login">click here</a>.<br /></p>
<div class="container">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#demo">GET FMR data
        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>/fmr/data/{entityid}</em></button>
    <br />
    <br />
    <div id="demo" class="collapse">
        <br />
        <div class="row">
            <label class="control-label col-sm-2 required" for="token">Access Token:</label>
            <div class="col-sm-10">
                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="token" placeholder="Enter Token" name="token">
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="row">
            <label class="control-label col-sm-2 required" for="fips">entityid:</label>
            <div class="col-sm-4 float-start">
                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="fips"
                    placeholder="Enter fips code for county or cbsa code for metroarea." name="fips">
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="row">
            <label class="control-label col-sm-2" for="year">year:</label>
